      <span class="okr-dot"></span><strong>OKR</strong>&ensp;15% of overall hires
      <div class="okr-menu" id="okrMenu">
        <div class="okr-opt selected" data-color="green"><span class="okr-dot" style="background:#22c55e"></span>On Track</div>
